 "name_en": "Proactive Maintenance (4HI)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Proactive Maintenance (4HI)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio54d8c9acac87467ea21a558721a3de21\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio54d8c9acac87467ea21a558721a3de21__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">You can create a maintenance schedule in the form of a maintenance plan. Maintenance plans include task lists and relevant assets. A task list contains a sequence of tasks that can be planned for resources such as material, service, capacity, and so on. Maintenance planning is carried out based on the performance of an asset or by using time-based strategy or both, which creates maintenance demand. This process supports all the phases of business cycle such as planning, approval, preparation, scheduling, execution, post execution, and completion.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio54d8c9acac87467ea21a558721a3de21__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">Proactive Maintenance – Time-Based</span></p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\"></span>Maintain a maintenance strategy</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a task list</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a maintenance plan</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Schedule a maintenance plan</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release a maintenance order for preparation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Review maintenance backlog for readiness</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Schedule a maintenance order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform time confirmation of pre- and main order operations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform time confirmation of post maintenance order operations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Complete technically</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">Proactive Maintenance – Performance-Based</span></p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain a maintenance strategy</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a task list</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a maintenance plan</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a measurement document</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Schedule a maintenance plan</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release a maintenance order for preparation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Review maintenance backlog for readiness</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Schedule a maintenance order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform time confirmation of pre- and main order operations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform time confirmation of post maintenance order operations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Complete technically</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio54d8c9acac87467ea21a558721a3de21__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Ensures high availability and utilization of assets</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Ensures optimal performance of assets</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduces total maintenance costs by minimizing breakdowns</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>主动维护 (4HI)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio54d8c9acac87467ea21a558721a3de21\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio54d8c9acac87467ea21a558721a3de21__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">您可以以维护计划的形式创建维护计划。维护计划包括任务清单和相关资产。任务清单包含可为资源（如物料、服务、产能等）计划的一系列任务。根据资产性能或使用基于时间的策略或两者执行维护计划，从而创建维护需求。此流程支持业务周期的所有阶段，例如计划、审批、准备、调度、执行、后执行和完成。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio54d8c9acac87467ea21a558721a3de21__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">主动维护 - 基于时间</span></p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\"></span>维护维护策略</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建任务清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建维护计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">安排维护计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">下达维护订单以进行准备</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">查看维护待办事项的准备情况</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">计划维护订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行订单工序前和主订单工序的时间确认</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行维护订单工序后的时间确认</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">技术上完成</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">主动维护 - 基于性能</span></p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">维护维护策略</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建任务清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建维护计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建测量凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">安排维护计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">下达维护订单以进行准备</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">查看维护待办事项的准备情况</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">计划维护订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行订单工序前和主订单工序的时间确认</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行维护订单工序后的时间确认</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">技术上完成</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio54d8c9acac87467ea21a558721a3de21__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">确保资产的高可用性和利用率</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确保资产的最佳性能</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过最小化故障降低总维护成本</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
